# ---- lamps ----
# shot ties (PAD-420): an insert's shot mask is every shot it stands in front of, read at the desk from the game's
# own names (a shot's switch name against the insert's: its arrow, its target's own light, its lane's light, the
# letter a target spells) and, where the device table places both, their playfield positions. A shot with no
# insert of its own stays untied; the inserts no shot owns (progress lights, modes, GI, flashers) stay 0.
